DefectImportPreviewResponseSchema-Input.description:
Diff preview returned before committing an xlsx import.

``has_changes`` is True when the diff contains any modification of pre-existing defects;
the frontend must show a confirmation dialog in that case.

DefectImportPreviewResponseSchema-Output.description:
Diff preview returned before committing an xlsx import.

``has_changes`` is True when the diff contains any modification of pre-existing defects;
the frontend must show a confirmation dialog in that case.
